OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers fade
OL,6,Fout in the evening to leave some clear
OL,7,Fspells before cloud and further
OL,8,Fshowery rain spreads east, clearing in
OL,9,Fthe early hours to allow some clear
OL,10,Fspells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA mix of variable cloud and
OL,13,Fsome bright spells with a scattering
OL,14,Fof light showers. Temperatures
OL,15,Freturning back to near normal.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,18,Fdry at the weekend with variable cloud
OL,19,Fand bright spells, and just a few
OL,20,Flight showers on Saturday. Likely
OL,21,Fturning wet and windy through Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
